B7KelqmtP2Rv9liUJRVr8JharEpBPaatGcAiD1w7qMhVwKFErAA0DQLV-YYMZqMQnr4p3XIvYMyZGHSAK44G\";i:5;s:494:\"places/ChIJH7y3WPeJvTMRerG0S9Gqm10/photos/AVoNoXQNzXMy1tdjVlW9HOhSBy6OeDBSZipsE8P9z14Yd4nWQSdVeTHwogLyARUcosE_5c4v0-ncy_0m2v_J9IvrgeUxiHkbRtkniXLgaFIWuWQSvgYrJ0W_JeHD5Rq3s2F-esOjrDTCDKYNmNk8m0Z6TsQYrR96ewdyhOCfG48Gxn4KgNKxY-uXHa7pPHMEXuHbvALuVKMv-v1BnusdTq3dkF95266AY-IQKAiiSg2xW8snj6rg-EaaQjTaQ9r-8xLyf4EcLxKaOGEKGtjdJ03EGxKyX1dCLs-SEVzZHJW1DJaOLy1k8tBc9LNrXvr7XZQaym8zT24MBqt1QiZGGHRJkVI8_6CKRIpQ6V3hdh-YgF7KY-HEXUksujALQF1UpMkh4bMX_pRsmXC_K3_bmHAKmzghdA_jWTEB5O2Q3pu2j5APQCbLeu6WXCXrV0cjbdjG\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:3:\"Lin\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVaRhCRRnmrIckKQVKzCRiBrgymHJx1K2_-zoKC7E3LPvhtaqIe=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:381:\"The food was good, especially the Special Bulalo. The service was great, we were assisted well and all of them were very friendly. The place was also pet-friendly, provided that your pet does not disturb other customers.\n\nThe buttered shrimp and buttered tahong was a bit too sweet for my taste, but I think thats just a panlasa difference.\n\nI would love to eat here again sometime\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-18T10:23:43.659881909Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:8:\"Coco Cha\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ9hE0AelJWFWkR-5gYSxLjdqataaIBK_5UBdedWBP2eNBGmg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:329:\"Our favorite food place in Ternate, food was really good. We ordered the set menu with multiple dishes inside.\n\nWe love that the servers are so tentative to everything we needed even gave fans directed to us so we feel better.\n\nWe visited on a few nights trip on route staying in the area and highly recommend this place as well.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-27T11:33:16.296452672Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Lawrence Agpasa\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWDiG704Gbz1ol8x0ZR9a-zBXJbs2pRVhXuxnoYWV0mndRNr6kfXw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:455:\"Quaint family-owned restaurant that offers staple Filipino dishes, offers good view of Ternate greenery. Diners of all ages are welcome, as of July 2021; small groups can choose to sit in one of the traditional kubos/kiosks; large groups in the roofed area on the left. Servers are courteous and responsive. Parking is free. Note that the restaurant only uses generators as electricity is not yet available in this side of the road. Toilet can be improved\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-07-04T04:01:27.430817Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:8:\"SVOEvent\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWKXgc8TVIDo9zgni7rYTlTvh8zlRwFqFoUDSmw76cQhHa1-SY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:352:\"A Restaurant to enjoy, good food, nice Service and nice View to enjoy your Stay. The Restaurante is frequented by Bikers and Motorist who ride the costal road. The Menue is made for couples as well as for Groups, there are menue options for 10 and 20 People. The Price is verry affordable for all what you get, they even serve coffee if you ask nicely.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-02-18T13:10:34.974426Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Niceynicey\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8T6qYP9Bh_X1DsRN-9vawTciq5HAII5qWCh687277YoC7nnzUTg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:164:\"The view is truly great. You can see the mountains and fields from the restaurant itself, enjoying fresh air, a good ambiance, and good food. The price is moderate.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-06-11T01:17:57.780235Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:3;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s: