=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:60:\"Great food with an amazing view?and courteous staff☺️\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-05T10:36:16.969886892Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Herbert Baron\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUnOz9Rk_QF7-PFcGCDO9_7iZobYqiewku0WEgcd94MDhs4HZoc6w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:146:\"Relaxing place with a great view of Benguet. It’s near Baguio. Delicious food, good service, and a perfect spot to unwind and enjoy the scenery.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-29T10:55:22.725266384Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:4:\"Kyle\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWx0cW5e45flfOzKupU--sHNswtF4VrQiOrS8lvcvj6_ntZLU1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:58:\"Perfect food + perfect spot. Will definitely come back! :)\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-10T10:31:04.430352187Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Floyd Amolot\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVOAQGwvoF5OGgQXLAweWdrmfEVbQegju21R0-wk9ogk4JRXoI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:4:\"?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-08-15T09:12:52.844721422Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:18;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJ4w6LAQB5jzMRaMkRWzMUlwc\";s:4:\"name\";s:20:\"Tabuk City Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:17.5654635;s:3:\"lng\";d:121.4799791;s:7:\"address\";s:52:\"HF8H+5XQ Balong, City of Tabuk, Kalinga, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJ4w6LAQB5jzMRaMkRWzMUlwc/photos/AVoNoXREu02i9YomPzTZIELRd0jasS7gOhRlIGPwSyehPN3qNjUOIPPccPuA_oMAYZ726--Aq2LeXoM_DJXjz3i2ghqS5hcqDuwueV7omBybIPyEHkhREl