465:\"We stopped by this Petron branch during a long ride late at night, and it was the only one open in the area—which we were really thankful for. All the staff were very polite and kind, making us feel welcome even at that hour. Their restroom was a pleasant surprise: clean, neat, and well-ventilated with an electric fan inside. It smelled good and was complete with essentials like hand soap and tissue. A great stop for late-night travelers—highly recommended!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-05-16T04:36:25.801576Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:1:\"N\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWP95vp81BZppsQjQSUd76RILz6bWIRTy_h4VCqLoEpvxtKDPmy=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:83:\"Very polite service. Located in a really good spot near the Camiling public market.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-01-25T16:57:32.510290Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:19:\"Philip lloyd Garcia\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVBl4hzxe1qlAIYs0ywmL6ynkREp9z89WSteNijeOlNbm3VF_ic=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:38:\"So clean fuel and food come fuel na...\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-10-03T06:32:34.690107Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"alexander vallefas\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXDm7OBvuWFDluRpVyClLzESrRhlEF0tWuWRWd0rLlMLiud-aI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:36:\"Good quality fuel service...and more\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2019-10-15T00:37:34.954036Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"PHILVALLEY AGRO\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWCEhsYuxt5o3uaFK_b2bbP2hbvFhlXo2BrQNq3t2Ci28KjvhG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:8:\"No good,\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2018-12-25T11:58:03.356194377Z\";s:6:\"source\";s: