e others. The male restroom is clean but has only one functioning urinal. The female restroom\'s toilet doesn\'t flush.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-11-13T10:20:41.498163Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Raphael Navarro\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV2-Sxs5_ru77ivpzuFPybbCZ2XparFlj2BO9hDGi8TuOab0Bc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:90:\"The newly opened Uno Fuel in Rosario, La Union.\nGreat for restroom stops and cheap fuels..\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-01-04T08:56:03.937851Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"nica literato\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUyGnJCWidSwtmYmcGnGt81ym4VSkrjDT3gmgWwKWN-g2S4co3W=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:352:\"This is a good restroom stop, especially since this is the last gas station that you can stop by when going south to TPLEX. But they only have one functioning restroom, so everyone would use the female restroom. The price of their fuel is lower compared to other gas stations around the province, so make sure you have your gas here before going north.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-05-16T14:54:13.006760Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:14;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJg2ZbVgFzkTMR3Lwkl0vgzW4\";s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Nedu Fuel Station\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.2349695;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.48746170000001;s:7:\"address\";s:59:\"6FMP+XXP, Pugo - Rosario Rd, Rosario, La Union, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:11:\"gas-station\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:6;s:7:\"reviews\";i:6;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJg2ZbVgFzkTMR3Lwkl0vgzW4/photos/AVoNoXRtpPHqyzpR6hM_0c5xoV9KdQBx3k2AeyUPINz6grPDVryg_mEja3dzPzp1I0Jouvd1MDRBI5015ztI9B3RMo8QcD5Oa0qGjDYsRA3Kb5j0xaLLdjF_zp7tyO0P-cKaKJoB4mhzF2t85lS5u-RUuLLghikxepI7cO4MuSMqnIkIm