ere homeless people also on the park grounds, and there was trash everywhere. This really affected the aesthetic and safety of the place.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-05-10T22:23:34.841110Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"greg hermosa\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXPwOP1dLTFBtYXgWSigTKAWKFMQQpAlZYTZDvTvmifICnwJvn8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:141:\"This iconic grandstand became witnessed in the historical National Peace Rally of Iglesia Ni Cristo with 1.8 Million in attendance. 13 Jan 25\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-01-22T06:19:14.678970Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"mai angeles\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVbnxcNWCRH4ngYtuDWbusGanjlD3oFa-8r0lYuF_ljE-_jzFIN=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:144:\"This is where I was able to complete my first 16k run through the Rexona Miler Series. Brough back a lot of memories esp the nearby places. ?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-01T18:01:23.749773089Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Jirehl John\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVBdtn5BQfbG0phqsOF4TH6fLDReTuWfXQx6wZgyE6hLIt9i1c-7g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:419:\"I used to only see this in TV. A place of gatherings all throughout history. Grand celebrations were held and as well as of the known hostage crisis event. Anyway, place isn\'t that grand in person. Would have been a nice place for a jog if not for the presence of so many homeless people. There is so much trash around, this place is a disappointment for local tourists who wanted to see the beauty of the capital city.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-11-20T22:57:26.815427Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"JP Travel Diary\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXe0WlGFHDxhIdNDqHgBNdEQTlwCBuv7yvDcCTWcgyR4eGzvaA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:193:\"This is a historical place and the go to location for government activities like fun run and rallies. The area is located in front of Luneta, adjacent to Manila Oceanpark. I love jogging here .\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-01-26T01:37:21.528404Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:100:\"Landmark auditorium from 1949 hosting rallies, presidential inaugurations & Independence Day events.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:9;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJeWcu0hfKlzMRnYOqfe-gowY\";s:4:\"name\";s:50:\"Minor Basilica of the Immaculate Conception Manila\";s:3:\"lat\";d:14.5917422;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.97339210000001;s:7:\"address\";s:76:\"Cabildo, 132 Beaterio St, Intramuros, Manila, 1002 Metro Manila, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.7;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:7797;s:7:\"reviews\";i:7797;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:478:\"places/ChIJeWcu0hfKlzMRnYOqfe-gowY/photos/AVoNoXQMSM5vEGn3u-HHZCOyxau_CHMhXugH-FD9rvEoL60_3xrKguebheHfim0OJhJ9AW5MIJBu0OEE4slfk_lRD5qhofmA7qwty0voqAAA7zZsTx9TDT6qKmIF3Fz5riESE1G_6-xJD6Rlou5CfNpHxsnCKCUVOzwSoOzgZsaD16XaiFYMyXHfDGYVqF2-kyNdTIagvGCwjwumCa2b1n33tbLoh6hliVws5-qW2SSyzHUSExomsG0YQCLLoRVI8GKIlKpzxUmGGwvGBpyMs6ZUElp7Pm94gTZ8sg-WVAKl3iZvG6LOB9t_pCJw3dH_Mg4f-TuZlPKgdnaYlAOMIEScrwXkBMsR0LfrYXDD288VNvZFjRESkeCVehzlVycZCTlu_N-JCMpcwfuuURkCNMm_Ef2wn_xYgYnegxxHoE0VyyP9gheb\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:478:\"places/ChIJeWcu0hfKlzMRnYOqfe-gowY/photos/AVoNoXQMSM5vEGn3u-HHZCOyxau_CHMhXugH-FD9rvEoL60_3xrKguebheHfim0OJhJ9AW5MIJBu0OEE4slfk_lRD5qhofmA7qwty0voqAAA7zZsTx9TDT6qKmIF3Fz5riESE1G_6-xJD6Rlou5CfNpHxsnCKCUVOzwSoOzgZsaD16XaiFYMyXHfDGYVqF2-kyNdTIagvGCwjwumCa2b1n33tbLoh6hliVws5-qW2SSyzHUSExomsG0YQCLLoRVI8GKIlKpzxUmGGwvGBpyMs6ZUElp7Pm94gTZ8sg-WVAKl3iZvG6LOB9t_pCJw3dH_Mg4f-TuZlPKgdnaYlAOMIEScrwXkBMsR0LfrYXDD288VNvZFjR