ially for families trying to meet up after the event.\n\nDespite this, the overall experience was positive. The renovation successfully modernized the facility while maintaining the elegance and prestige that PICC is known for.\n\nOverall Rating: 8/10\n\nBeautifully restored and well-maintained, with room for improvement in post-event crowd and guest movement management.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-19T05:37:06.864027388Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Kenn Gumonan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcrKvTwuBc96JzbSfbQdHD0x8uZDVcj07cvu1pDgVH8ynp9S53=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:913:\"My visit to the Philippine International Convention Center was a great and meaningful experience. I attended the DOST NRCP conference and general membership assembly, and the venue was very suitable for the event.\nThe place is clean, spacious, and well organized. It was easy to move around, and the environment was comfortable for all participants. The restrooms were also clean and well maintained, which I really appreciate. Security is good, and I felt safe during the entire event.\nWhat I appreciated the most was the customer service. After the event, my friends and I stayed in the lobby and were assisted by Ms. Arminda Matabang. She was very kind, helpful, and patient in answering our questions and guiding us. Her service made our experience even better.\nOverall, I had a very positive experience at PICC. I highly recommend this place for conferences and big events. Looking forward to visiting again.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-17T14:19:30.637692296Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:21:\"Charles David Bernido\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2MUCp4QL7uEd-cdcKXpZul20ipRdPc9ReAKQTcmZ3XyfCdySN6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:286:\"Had a great time at the Exit Conn event at the newly renovated PICC Reception Hall. The place looked fresh, elegant, and well-kept, and it gave the event a really nice atmosphere. It felt more modern while still keeping that grand PICC feel. Definitely a great venue for special events.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-20T11:54:31.280795830Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"ForkAndVerdict\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHuKniBDBDtDil4-G5Ih6A3uN94mssU9FSllbH8f_K_6pEc6o=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:214:\"Went here for a graduation but I guess every other school also graduates here? It\'s a nice convention center with fancy decor and furnishing. I wonder if this is also where they have high stake government meetings.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-11T01:34:24.934386378Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:7:\"kyo kyo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWgZl6ekKnS8RUs8NOz37SM0kXGHn6PnMpHSw0xjTM6RqW7Xjw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:1179:\"Attended a graduation here, but the lady guard kept threatening guests and graduates that they would not be allowed inside instead of helping manage the line properly. The situation could have been handled much better from the start. Guests were made to wait at the entrance, which resulted in a traffic jam.\n\nThe problem was not that guests weren\'t listening. The issue was the poor crowd management. We were suggesting that people at the back move farther back to allow those at the front to enter and ease the congestion, but our suggestions were ignored. Ironically, they eventually did exactly that and allowed guests to walk in, which is what we had been recommending from the beginning.\n\nThe staff seemed unprepared to handle and organize a situation involving a large crowd. First, fix the entrance system. If 500+ people are expected to enter, why is there only a one-way entrance? I also heard that PICC was recently renovated, which makes the poor crowd flow even more disappointing.\n\nConsider hiring professional event organizers or crowd management personnel who are experienced in handling events of this size. Also, only two guards are managing 500+ guests outside\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-28T17:53:23.500777663Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:18;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJdZRIcurLlzMRAwQo8NyVtEA\";s:4:\"name\";s:16:\"Manila Bay Beach\";s:3:\"lat\";d:14.5749729;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.97956119999999;s:7:\"address\";s:67:\"Baywalk, Roxas Blvd, Malate, Manila, 1004 Metro Manila, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.2;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:6618;s:7:\"reviews\";i:6618;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJdZRIcurLlzMRAwQo8NyVtEA/photos/AVoNoXR-xfNrflwSj7Fk_2qCqkXWlfAmNi4gq0qHgqaBTZFduIeUGWdIyM6RdnUx3kmJmYKFoWzvtN0aZhS5Jfin7QRslkOrDyod5cBvW-3EimrcvETAn80HyXaP0dcnX-Ql9quhOvSzDbE5sXgP2kn--bMVNUV2CHMgUuHhse2krmu_fTH5hD74NZD9SVm1OxEGSTUP48RCsqrEI0sStQ12MvWzzHlgUYX0k5Q8foH9Uq0vaE6q7imwNtHaRdXw02Uh0MoE6LWEoqYwDhQJPsz1_kPrt8DVMMlxgHUpLuFV8Qg5NPbNUXDZAiDQvVPRBxr-ndRfGJCz2yHrirqGinD_Jc12WOZlzMLnLGTWshtxMEWQPuZXuil5KMTjoUVmqVSdhH4kb-eqysTHz3hsTAvZh_wYalehnh6T3tTxc4CTonoicEqJfCOuYtLSn9lxHTrL\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:494:\"places/ChIJdZRIcurLlzMRAwQo8NyVtEA/photos/AVoNoXR-xfNrflwSj7Fk_2qCqkXWlfAmNi4gq0qHgqaBTZFduIeUGWdIyM6RdnUx3kmJmYKFoWzvtN0aZhS5Jfin7QRslkOrDyod5cBvW-3EimrcvETAn80HyXaP0dcnX-Ql9quhOvSzDbE5sXgP2kn--bMVNUV2CHMgUuHhse2krmu_fTH5hD74NZD9SVm1OxEGSTUP48RCsqrEI0sStQ12MvWzzHlgUYX0k5Q8foH9Uq0vaE6q7imwNtHaRdXw02Uh0MoE6LWEoqYwDhQJPsz1_kPrt8DVMMlxgHUpLuFV8Qg5NPbNUXDZAiDQvVPRBxr-ndRfGJCz2yHrirqGinD_Jc12WOZlzMLnLGTWshtxMEWQPuZXuil5KMTjoUVmqVSdhH4kb-eqysTHz3hsTAvZh_wYalehnh6T3tTxc4CTonoicEqJfCOuYtLSn9lxHTrL\";i:1;s:478:\"places/ChIJdZRIcurLlzMRAwQo8NyVtEA/photos/AVoNoXQCqiVkVmX8SVlIpEdYFKH0duI4qqJWTZK3TOO1