ent here with her family just to try out their playground. Before they left she went to the restroom and got greeted by the guy asking for p10 for maintenance fee for using the restroom no big deal but the guy wont get out of the restroom it took our friend maybe a couple of times or so asking him to leave fortunately our friend finished her business when the guy went back in the restroom like what hes doing is normal. There is something wrong with that guy. May not be today but that he will hurt someone one of these days. I hope the officers would take action before something bad happens.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-27T02:16:22.950773907Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Nathaniel Ramirez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUwqhmFW4tzAUVIVbfG0VN9aFB1Li1ZMBEH9D7XGTaiDZagnxma=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:57:\"Love the new redesign, it looks eco-friendly and spacious\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-06-08T09:57:43.430658Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"marcuvinn arganoza\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK2CaPRUk0Df0qDTvp3V5j6XNOpppzi5oQtsIdJY072OYAwBg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:84:\"Road from Tarlac City to Pangasinan passing through Santa Ignacia is safe to travel.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-12-07T03:08:31.459319Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Carlos Sioco\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX-hDHd6_GfHVS3CL7ihcUnXntLuC05wxYhrGX2xSJwhOoIJ1t0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:49:\"Beautiful and clean park good for rest many trees\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-09-01T03:54:01.393676Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Reymart Baybado\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVYHEKvGtcWUw_vkBzDmqoYooWzNlOUE7K_iaV0